422
00:32:28.800 --> 00:32:30.900
Dong Min bisa segera dibebaskan.

423
00:32:30.900 --> 00:32:34.133
Setelah kami membuktikan Ga Seon Yeong berada di belakang Gil Ho Se,

424
00:32:34.133 --> 00:32:37.233
